From a3b25dee6b80de1b80ca49f3821b849e19546311 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Goose contributors <goose@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:30:24 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Support explicit alignment for structs and enums

Preserve declared alignment in variables, arrays and runtime data stacks.
Validate layouts and report alignment through the native interface metadata.
---
